  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When disabling an UdonBehaviour in Start, it will still run the Update event once, even though the behaviour is disabled. This is different than MonoBehaviour's execution. Having the Update method run here could cause issues with unexpected execution and thus requires a check for if the behaviour is enabled, which is unnecessary for all other executions of the event.\nPlease prevent Update events from being executed if the behaviour is disabled or the GameObject is inactive.\nSample Graph:\napplication/vnd.unity.graphview.elements ",
